Description: Lenovo Yoga Book YB1-X91L sensor and thermal integration
 Identifies the display and base accelerometers exposed by both Yoga Book
 sensor hubs, supplies their mount matrices for desktop automatic rotation,
 and provides the SX9310 proximity threshold required by iio-sensor-proxy.
 .
 It also supplies a hardware-scoped thermald policy for CPU, platform, battery,
 and charger temperature control. It does not contain keyboard, pen, audio,
 firmware, camera, or kernel components.
